      "diagnosis": "The skill underspecifies or misstates the task’s completion requirements and deliverable constraints (generation of all mandated q01.json–q05.json files, exact schemas, ordering/sorting, rounding, null/missing handling, and error/fallback behavior). It also provides incorrect or incomplete logic for Q02 TAL reporting by failing to deterministically select the handbook-defined representative/worst-case/cold-spot thermocouple, leading to inconsistent or wrong TAL/compliance outputs when multiple TCs exist per run.",
